== Acquisition ==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be bought from the [[Borderline Justice Premium Warbond|Borderline Justice]] page of the [[Superstore#Permanent_Catalog|Permanent Catalog]] on the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|300|notext}} and 150 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

